        "summary": "CLI renderer sets useAlternateScreen: true in createCliRenderer. Terminal reset sequences now include \\x1b[?1049l to exit alternate screen buffer. Scope: cli/src/index.tsx, cli/src/utils/renderer-cleanup.ts. Cleanup handler writes reset codes directly to stdout.",
